{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"865913981406806046","name":"samuel-adams","position":59,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"What is your opinion on the occupation of Arcania by the british crown and the crown in general?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:39:35.004000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870042828816924673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I do not. Like it. Very much. It killed me. Once. And put me. In jail,\" they frown, slightly. \"I also. Did not. Enjoy. Having my things. Taken. From me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:42:56.270000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870043672987701338","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"At least. I think. It may have. Killed me. I am still. Somewhat unclear. On that front.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:43:23.353000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870043786582052876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"One last question: are you willing to go to great and dangerous lengths to end the occupation of Arcania and ensure the freedom of her and her peoples?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:43:45.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870043881297805363","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They hum, again. \"I do not know. But I have done. More. For less. And I do not. Enjoy. People being bullied.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:45:23.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870044292041805894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They look to you. \"I need a commitment. Can you do that?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:47:16.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870044766186930207","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"A faint pause. Too long in faerie town, maybe. \"Yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:48:08.212000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870044981367300136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They smile and extend a hand to shake. \"Then  welcome aboard.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:49:06.038000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870045223907131412","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Thank. You,\" they smile. Take the hand, not quite sure what to do with it.","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:49:36.554000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870045351900483674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod, their wisp of white hair bobbing under the hood. They reach out and tap you gently on the forehead, and you are suddenly given the memory of directions to somewhere. \"I believe you have somewhere to go.\" They smile","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:50:38.599000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870045612136104077","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
