{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Vivica walks up to them and hands them a note, she says nothing but is watching them closely","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:32:22.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870524197548462091","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They take the note and indicate for you to sit.","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:36:04.523000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870525129816416377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"She does so (Dm I do that)","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:36:27.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870525225886949396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Hello Vivica, I'm glad to see you accepted the invitation. How have you been? Spent a long time away.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:38:02.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870525624001892353","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"She looks suspicious \"I'm well. Your letter said someone in you ranks trusts me. Who?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:39:24.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870525969889386576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I'm sure you understand why I cannot tell you this right away. Should you decide to join and answer a few questions, i will be more than happy to let you know however.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:41:58.585000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870526614860103701","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"She leans back, \"Fair enough, can you at least tell me your name?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:42:32.055000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870526755243458571","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They shake their head once more. \"I can, however, tell you who i represent. An arm of the revolution.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:45:18.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870527452164812831","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Vivica gives up asking questions \"Go on..\" her interest is peaked","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:46:05.257000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870527649477439520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"We've been familiar with your... endeavors for a while. We were considering inviting you to join us before you left, but well...\" they trail off slightly. \"The point is, you're back and clearly still in the same sorts of businesses. We'd like to make things more... official. In order to do that, you'll have to answer some questions to make sure we can still trust you. Is that amenable?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:48:13.417000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870528187019427861","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I see. Well it seems our interests are aligned then. Ask away.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:49:42.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870528560232820747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure slides a mug of fizzing liquid to you which seemed to appear from nowhere. \"I will ask that you drink this first, as a precaution. We need to be absolutely certain of the veracity of your answers.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:52:15.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870529202158456882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Vivica takes the mug and inspects it. \"What you don't trust me?\" her voice is teasing as she downs the drink","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:53:26.002000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870529498095951883","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"It tastes fizzy and pleasant. You are unable to lie to the figure for the next hour.","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:54:37.976000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870529799976796210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Do you have any aliases you have gained since your departure from the city ten years ago?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:55:03.134000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870529905497083986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Yes, I have met with several lords and ladies in France who have sent supplies to Washington and his men.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:55:59.033000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870530139954491462","reply_to_id":"870529905497083986","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Do you have any other new aliases?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:58:11.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870530696362487828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I made new ones here in the city, Nolan, Sonny, Sabrine. Even reconnected with some old friends, Finn and Eliza.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:59:21.599000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870530989577871420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod, satisfied. \"Do you or have you ever worked for the british crown? If so when, why, and what were your duties?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:01:54.751000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870531631943942184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I have not, I've never even set foot in England and like a true revolutionary I would never dare work for the crown.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:03:01.378000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T05:03:08.870000Z","id":"870531911397806150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"(I read this wrong, my b)","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:03:40.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870532077441921054","reply_to_id":"870530696362487828","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod. \"Do you have any intentions of sharing any secrets learned from us with those not a part of our organization?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:07:19.283000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870532993129787412","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Nope.\" She says simply","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:07:34.421000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870533056623173692","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"What are your opinions of the british occupation of Arcania and the British crown itself?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:10:14.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870533727787315221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I wan't them out of Arcania. I never cared for the crown, they can go back to their little island across the ocean.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:11:29.642000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870534043211538502","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod. \"As for those aliases, I believe you listed friends rather than aliases. Would you be willing to clarify that?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:13:42.028000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870534598478692382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Oh I heard alies, my fault. I have picked up aliases in the past but I rarely reuse them. Only needed to use one or twice to gain information.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:15:31.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870535059025833984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod. \"Quite understandable. One final question: are you willing to go to great and dangerous lengths to end the occupation by the british, protect arcania, and ensure freedom for her and her peoples?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:18:57.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870535921903235092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I already have, adding to it is no issue for me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:19:46.090000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870536125465395251","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure smiles and extends a hand. \"The name's Trapero. Welcome aboard.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:21:52.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870536654417457172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Vivica takes their hand \"It's a pleasure to meet you Trapero.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:23:21.837000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870537030373867520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Likewise.\" They take their hand and press a finger to your forehead, and you see memories not yours of traveling to a location in Ferrytown. \"As for who recommended you, it was your friend Finn. Now then, I believe you may have somewhere to be.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:27:11.043000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870537991733542963","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
